 "scenes": [
  {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Next, tell Job Explorer what you're looking for.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-5\\voice\\3f0b0e555db07ff3.wav",
     "seconds": 2.747625
    },
    {
     "text": "Open Searches, and create your first search.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-5\\voice\\c9c7924ec651de65.wav",
     "seconds": 2.370625
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Give it a name, then add the job titles you want.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-5\\voice\\1712ac32af8d4086.wav",
     "seconds": 2.8821666666666665
    },
    {
     "text": "Press enter after each one.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-5\\voice\\42b6a8fc873049ea.wav",
     "seconds": 1.5967083333333334
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Describe the job you want in your own words.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-5\\voice\\5bd3e08599909aab.wav",
     "seconds": 2.484541666666667
    },
    {
     "text": "The AI uses this to judge how well each job fits.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-5\\voice\\b0dfd4c955158853.wav",
     "seconds": 3.2104583333333334
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Add the skills you want the job to center on.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-5\\voice\\e14841ce3afcd59c.wav",
     "seconds": 2.2098333333333335
    },
    {
     "text": "You can also list skills you have, but don't want as the main part of the job.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-5\\voice\\e217ab891f78487e.wav",
     "seconds": 4.1825
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Then choose where you'll work.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-5\\voice\\34a676acd204def0.wav",
     "seconds": 1.3453333333333333
    },
    {
     "text": "Onsite and hybrid jobs can be limited to cities near you, and remote jobs to the countries you can work in.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-5\\voice\\359b84544f0746f0.wav",
     "seconds": 6.409916666666667
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Below that are more filters, like a minimum salary, seniority, and how recent a posting must be.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-5\\voice\\1cb1b07eb12a0af2.wav",
     "seconds": 6.205416666666666
    },
    {
     "text": "The defaults are a good place to start.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-5\\voice\\d33f7c933acbb8fe.wav",
     "seconds": 1.9980833333333334
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "When you're happy with it, click save search.",
     "file": "C:\\Users\\Raven\\Desktop\\Projects\\DemoReel\\work\\job-explorer\\getting-started\\part-5\\voice\\1757fb26b4954c40.wav",
     "seconds": 2.0900416666666666
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}